lor: #ff00ff;\"><b>01/01/2026</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :<strong> 18 Years for All Other Post</strong></li>\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>21 years for Jail Superintend </strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>33 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per MPESB MP Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak (Karyapalik) (Van Vibhag), Jail Prahari (Karyapalik)(Jail Vibhag) and Jail Superintend Combined Recruitment Test 2026&nbsp;&nbsp;Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>MPESB MP Van Rakshak, Jail Prahari Recruitment 2026 : <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Total : 1679 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>MPESB MP Van Rakshak, Jail Prahari &amp; Other Post Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Vanrakshak</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">728</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th High School Exam Passed.</li>\n<li>Height Male : 163 CMS, Female 150 CMS.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Kshetra Rakshak</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">169</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th High School Exam Passed</li>\n<li>Height Male : 163 CMS, Female 150 CMS.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Jail Prahari</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">757</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th High School Exam Passed</li>\n<li>Height Male : 165 CMS, Female 158 CMS.</li>\n<li>800 Meter Race in 2 Min 50 Second <strong>Male</strong></li>\n<li>800 Meter Race in 4 Min <strong>Female</strong></li>\n<li>Gola Fek : <strong>Male</strong> Through 20 Feet, <strong>Female</strong> Through : 16 Feet</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Jail Superintend</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">25</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>Height Male : 168 CMS, Female 155 CMS.</li>\n<li>More PET Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill MPESB MP Police Vanrakshak Forest Guard &amp; Other Post Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MPESB MP Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak (Karyapalik) (Van Vibhag), Jail Prahari (Karyapalik)(Jail Vibhag) and Jail Superintend Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>28/02/2026 to 30/04/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in MPESB MP Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak (Karyapalik) (Van Vibhag), Jail Prahari (Karyapalik)(Jail Vibhag) and Jail Superintend&nbsp;&nbsp;Recruitment 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full MPESB Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak, Jail Prahari &amp; Jail Superintend Exam 2026 Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"MPESB Van Rakshak Jail Prahari Exam Admit Card 2026\" href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/tacs/tac_2026/JAIL_VAN_TAC26/default_tac.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download New Exam Notice</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"MPESB Van Rakshak Jail Prahari Exam Notice 2026\" href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/Advertisement/ADV_2026/Vanrakshak_JailPrahari_2026_ExamDateChange_20052026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n<